<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
   <head>
      <meta charset="UTF-8" />
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
      <title>Rawand Khalid - full-stack Web Developer</title>
      <style>
         :root {
            color-scheme: light dark;

            --bg: light-dark(#ffffff, #121212);
            --text: light-dark(#1a1a1a, #e6e6e6);
            --muted: light-dark(#555555, #a0a0a0);
            --accent: light-dark(#0b57d0, #8ab4f8);
         }
         * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
         }
         body {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 768px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 10px;
            font-family: Times, serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
         }
         h1,
         h2,
         h3 {
            text-transform: capitalize;
            color: var(--accent);
         }
         a {
            color: var(--accent);
         }
         li::marker {
            color: var(--muted);
         }
         p {
            max-width: 80ch;
            text-wrap: pretty;
         }
         .skills {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            h2 {
               grid-column: span 2;
            }
         }
      </style>
   </head>
   <body>
      <header>
         <h1>Rawand Khalid</h1>
         <p>
            I am a full-stack web developer with experience in building, deploying, and maintaining modern web
            applications. My work covers frontend development, backend systems, databases, cloud platforms, DevOps
            workflows, CMS platforms, and server management.
         </p>
      </header>
      <main>
         <section>
            <h2>Awards</h2>
            <h3>Skill 17 WorldSkills Germany</h3>
            <p>
               Won the Silver Medal at WorldSkills Germany 2025 (Skill 17), qualifying for the Albert Einstein Cup 2026.
               There, I represented Germany against 11 nations and secured 5th place.
            </p>
         </section>
         <section class="skills">
            <h2>Skills</h2>
            <div>
               <h3>frontend</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>JS/TS</li>
                  <li>HTML/CSS</li>
                  <li>SASS/SCSS</li>
                  <li>Framer Motion</li>
                  <li>React</li>
                  <li>Next.js</li>
                  <li>Astro</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>backend</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>Laravel</li>
                  <li>Node.js</li>
                  <li>Express.js</li>
                  <li>Bun</li>
                  <li>PHP</li>
                  <li>Rust</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>cloud</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>Google Cloud</li>
                  <li>Cloudflare</li>
                  <li>Vercel</li>
                  <li>DigitalOcean</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>tools</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>Git</li>
                  <li>Docker</li>
                  <li>Figma</li>
                  <li>Postman</li>
                  <li>VS Code/Sublime Text</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>database</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>SQLite</li>
                  <li>MySQL</li>
                  <li>MariaDB</li>
                  <li>PostgreSQL</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>cms</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>WordPress</li>
                  <li>Drupal</li>
                  <li>Blogger.com</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>server</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>Linux Ubuntu/Debian</li>
                  <li>Nginx/Apache</li>
                  <li>PM2</li>
                  <li>cPanel</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
               <h3>languages</h3>
               <ul>
                  <li>Kurdish</li>
                  <li>English</li>
                  <li>Arabic</li>
                  <li>German</li>
               </ul>
            </div>
         </section>
      </main>
   </body>
</html>
